From 510a417ccdec74409a7a94cd7ac55cabc519f1cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:43:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: type coin database and block storage diagnostics

Convert 11 producers, preserving severity/category, numeric MiB and counter semantics, disk positions, public hashes and original failure returns. BlockIndex text remains for its readable multi-value summary; a raw hash is recorded separately. The uint64 database version is numeric rather than truncated.

Scripted diff commands:
/private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/convert.py --root . --rules contrib/logging/conversion/rules/core-storage-diagnostics.json --report /private/tmp/logging-core-storage-report.json --apply
git clang-format --force --binary /opt/homebrew/bin/clang-format --style "{BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig, BreakStringLiterals: false}" HEAD -- src/txdb.cpp src/node/blockstorage.cpp
python3 test/lint/lint-log-events.py src/txdb.cpp src/node/blockstorage.cpp
git diff --check

Source-only: NOT_COMPILED / NOT_RUN. Error branches not forced; no runtime validation claimed. Keep the native payload-limit diagnostic in its separate V2 owner.
